Check: **`cargo package` fails before the first publish, and that is expected.** Until `cargo-smysl-git` exists on crates.io, any crate depending on it reports `no matching package named cargo-smysl-git found`. Only wave 1 can be packaged or verified locally; the rest can be checked only as the waves land.

